<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n101177" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συνων-έομαι</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>buy together, collect by purchase</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νησιῶται ἵππον συνωνέονται μυρίην</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					1.27
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>buy up</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σῖτον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Lys.
					22.6
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>HG</u>
				5.4.56
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μαθήματα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Sph.</u>
					224b
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θηρία</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Brut.</u>
					21
				</span></i>
			:—
				Pass.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προσέταξεν [χρυσὸν] συνωνηθῆναι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>POxy.</u>
					2106.4
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(iv A.D.)</span>:—the pf <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συνεώνημαι</span> is used as 
				Pass.
			, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁ συνεωνημένος
			[σῖτος</span>] corn <i>bought up</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Lys.
				22.12
			</span></i>; but with act. sense in <i><span class="en">
				D.
				13.30
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				23.208
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>assist</i> one <i>to buy</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>Char.</u>
				2.7
			</span></i>.</div>
